& [IR3ActivationPackInvalidationRuleSet] is the staleness contract for IR3OperatorHarnessActivationPackV1
  + [invalidated_by] is change to IR3 source manifest, canonical specification, slice surface, or SJS signature basis
  + [invalidated_by] is change to any accepted IR3-S01 through IR3-S05 output hash
  + [invalidated_by] is change to any IR3-S01 through IR3-S06 completion review that affects support, requirements, or gates
  + [invalidated_by] is operator runner, trace, fixture, generated artifact, dependency, file inventory, or safety behavior exceeding the exported boundaries
  + [invalidated_by] is generated trace promoted to source authority
  + [invalidated_by] is silent mutation of SOP authority files by runner or fixture implementation
  + [invalidated_by] is operations control or live machine control leak

  = must: rerun IR3-S06 or rebake the relevant surface after invalidation before downstream work consumes this pack again
